[1;36mTopic: Galaxy
The game takes place in a galaxy made up of sectors. Each sector is 10000 by
10000 subsectors square. The size of the galaxy is based on the game mode and
how many players are participating. Sectors are mapped on a two coordinate
system, and each sector is measured from the top left to bottom right as shown
below:

[0;31m+-------------------------------+   +-------------------------------+
