HLPJET {
[1;36mThe [1;37mJETTISON[1;36m command permits you to dump goods from your ship. You can dump a
specific number, or all you have of an item type. You are not allowed to
jettison people. Issue the command as follows:

[1;37m  jettison [1;32m[[1;37mall[1;32m/amount] [item]

  amount[1;36m = the amount you want to jettison (or [1;37mall[1;36m)

  [1;32mitem[1;36m:
    [1;37mmis[1;36m = jettison missiles     [1;37mmin[1;36m = jettison mines
    [1;37mtor[1;36m = jettison torpedoes    [1;37mjam[1;36m = jettison jammers
    [1;37mdec[1;36m = jettison decoys       [1;37mzip[1;36m = jettison zippers
    [1;37mflu[1;36m = jettison flux pods    [1;37mgol[1;36m = jettison gold

Examples: [1;37mjettison ALL mis
          jet 50 min
} T GE help jettison message

